+
+## 2. Handlers
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Export a handler from each endpoint that takes the environment, and keep the default export on `process.env` (api)
+- [ ] 2.2 Pass the environment through the fetchers to the retryer, and let `request` use `fetch` on Cloudflare (src/fetchers, src/common/retryer.js, src/common/utils.js)
+
+## 3. The worker
+
+- [ ] 3.1 Add the worker entrypoint, the request and response adapters, and `wrangler.toml` (cloudflare/index.js) [AC-1]
